---
title: "withdrawExcessInvestedCapital (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_guard1: whenNotPaused
    q_guard1 --> q_guard2: whenSaleNotCanceled
    q_guard2 --> q_verifySig: _verifySignatureNotUsed(claimExcessSignature)
    q_verifySig --> q_verifyPos: _verifyValidPosition(claimExcessSignature, positionId, CLAIM_EXCESS)
    q_verifyPos --> q_verifyExcess: _verifyCanClaimExcessCapital(positionId)
    q_verifyExcess --> q_markSig: s_usedSignatures[msg.sender][claimExcessSignature] = true
    q_markSig --> q_calcExcess: excessAmount = capitalInvested - investAmount
    q_calcExcess --> q_updatePos: s_investorPositions[msg.sender].capitalInvested -= excessAmount
    q_updatePos --> q_markExcess: s_investorPositions[msg.sender].hasClaimedExcess = true
    q_markExcess --> q_transfer: safeTransfer(msg.sender, excessAmount)
    q_transfer --> q_emit: emit ExcessCapitalWithdrawn(excessAmount, msg.sender, positionId)
    q_emit --> [*]: return

    note right of q_verifyExcess
        INV-001: Investor can only claim excess once (hasClaimedExcess == false)
        INV-002: excessAmount = capitalInvested - accepted investAmount
    end note

    note right of q_calcExcess
        INV-003: After excess withdrawal, capitalInvested reflects accepted amount
        INV-004: investAmount comes from off-chain calculation signed by Legion
    end note
